# Test: path_parameter_changed

## Old Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /users/{userId}:
    get:
      operationId: getUser
      parameters:
        - name: userId
          in: path
          required: true
          schema:
            type: integer
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
```

## New Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /users/{userId}:
    get:
      operationId: getUser
      parameters:
        - name: userId
          in: path
          required: true
          schema:
            type: string
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
```

